- Corridor/walkway/supply source samples use the same validity rules as final placement.
0.18.9 -> 0.18.10 : walkway branching now mirrors corridor branching: terminal snaps extend on the host tangent, mid-run branches leave on the destination-side perpendicular, and exact shared host centerline vertices produce deterministic seamless T/Y junctions without overlap
0.18.10 -> 0.18.11 : cumulative four-material construction economy integration retained/packaged; walkway blueprint routing now uses corridor-style fixed-order curve sampling and deterministic route-side selection to prevent section/frame flipping while moving the cursor
0.19.2 - Storage Dome moved to Habitats/Infrastructure; Small/Mid/Big/Huge tiers; fixed corridor/supply docking ports; dome/network placement snapping.
